## Interface: 11509, 16001
## Title: OverlapSettingsGuard
## Notes: Keeps settings that overlap another installed add-on switched off, and explains why when one is switched on. Type /osg.
## Author: Rex Sun
## Version: 0.5.1
## OptionalDeps: RXPGuides, TalentsForeverBook, YUI, EllesmereUI, EllesmereUIUnitFrames, EllesmereUIRaidFrames, EllesmereUINameplates

Core.lua
Policy.lua
Adapters/RestedXP.lua
Adapters/YUI.lua
Adapters/EllesmereUI.lua
Guard.lua
